{"id":"n62514-1-10","stage":0,"title":"에어컨 · 空调","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62514-1-10-1","ko":"엄마, 더워 죽겠어요.","zh":"妈妈，热死我了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더워","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죽겠어요.","meaning":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","explanation":"죽다：表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77246","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"66bd3b1f27c0ee2e","term":"죽다","zh":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3","entryId":"77246","definition":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","pronunciation":["죽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/156a436850880ea38dce.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62514-1-10-2","ko":"에어컨을 좀 틀렴.","zh":"把空调打开吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"에어컨을","meaning":"空调","explanation":"에어컨：空调；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"에어컨","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62514","senseId":"1","lemma":"에어컨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b